OL,3,ABurnham thanks well-wishers following
OL,4,Ahis father's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has thanked
OL,7,Fparty leaders for their support
OL,8,Ffollowing the death of his father, Roy,
OL,9,Fon Monday.
OL,11,FAll opposition leaders sent condolences
OL,12,Fto him as he cancelled engagements
OL,13,Fearlier this week.
OL,15,FBurnham had previously spoken about the
OL,16,Ffact his dad did not know he had become
OL,17,Fprime minister, due to his advanced
OL,18,FAlzheimer's.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
