OL,3,ABurnham thanks well-wishers following
OL,4,Ahis father's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FPosting on social media, he thanked
OL,7,F"everyone who has shared a kind message
OL,8,Fabout my dad, particularly the leaders
OL,9,Fof the other parties".
